# Only these project roots are eligible for tracking.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/CONTENT_SOURCES.md
!/DEPLOYMENT.md
!/public/
!/.github/

# Credentials, local tooling and generated archives must stay local.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/credentials*
**/secrets*
**/.DS_Store
**/node_modules/
**/.openai/
**/.sites-runtime/
**/*.log
**/*.zip
**/*.tar.gz
